sequenceDiagram
    participant Tool as Tool
    participant Host as EVE host
    participant Res as Resource
    participant Store as Object storage

    Tool->>Host: Text summary plus ResourceLink
    Note over Host: URI, name, and mime type only
    Host->>Res: resources/read
    Res-->>Host: File bytes
    Host->>Store: Store the bytes
    Host->>Host: Replace the link with an artifact stub
